  "Viridian City:6,23:Fisher:greeting" has "FISHER: I enjoy a quiet spot near the water. The city sounds softer from here.".
  "Viridian City:17,5:Old Man:greeting" has "OLD MAN: I have seen many trainers pass through Viridian. Each has their own way of learning.".
