  "Forest South Gate:8,4:Girl:greeting" has "GIRL: The forest can be confusing. I like to pay attention to where I have been.".
  "Forest South Gate:2,4:Girl:greeting" has "GIRL: I look forward to seeing what Pokemon live among the trees.".
